menu "LP Core Deep Sleep Test Configuration"

    config TEST_LP_GPIO_SLEEP_PIN
        int "GPIO pin wired between the two boards for LP GPIO tests"
        default 2
        help
            RTC GPIO used for LP GPIO input, output, interrupt, and deep-sleep
            wakeup. The same pin number must be wired between the two boards.
            On ESP32-C5 this is also the default LP I2C SDA pin, so the I2C and
            GPIO cases run one at a time with the wire left connected.

endmenu
